[00:13.68]You left a little room
[00:16.44]At the end of every line
[00:19.16]Not empty, only open
[00:22.36]Not silent, only kind
[00:24.92]I learned the shape of pauses
[00:28.18]The warmth of almost said
[00:30.80]How something unfinished
[00:33.66]Could still be understood
[00:36.18]There we were
[00:40.54]Between the words
[00:43.94]Holding the air
[00:46.28]Without a name
[00:48.18]There we were
[00:51.80]Softly aligned
[00:54.08]Never too much
[00:57.36]Never the same
[01:13.94]You smiled inside the serious
[01:15.90]I hid light in reply
[01:18.42]Small sparks in the quiet
[01:21.36]Small weather in the sky
[01:24.30]No need to pull it closer
[01:27.24]No need to turn away
[01:29.98]Some doors open gently
[01:33.08]By leaving them that way
[01:36.02]There we were
[01:39.84]Between the words
[01:42.14]
[01:43.76]Holding the air
