[01:51.06]Softly aligned
[01:53.52]Never too much
[01:56.64]Never the same
[02:13.98]Some rooms get loud
[02:15.30]When nothing is heard
[02:17.98]We found more space
[02:21.04]In half a word
[02:27.38]There we were
[02:28.50]Between the words
